# Site-local dictionary additions. The stock /etc/freeradius/3.0/dictionary
# already $INCLUDEs this file by FreeRADIUS packaging convention.
#
# MikroTik-Rate-Limit, MikroTik-Address-List etc. ship in FreeRADIUS's own
# dictionary.mikrotik — included explicitly here rather than assumed, since
# whether it's pulled in by default varies by how the base image's top-level
# dictionary file was assembled.
$INCLUDE dictionary.mikrotik
